 "transcript": [
  "the second son (to Chen Fu): \"It is a good thing to do, for the young men must have their own houses and wives and their land must be sold and then they can buy land elsewhere when the land is higher in price. That way they can make more money than they can now from the land. I have a field in the south of the town that I have been thinking of selling for a good price.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son looks on at his brother's business proposal and feels jealous.",
  "[action] stands and paces",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Chen Fu expresses his disapproval of his son's plans.",
  "[action] Chen Fu sits beside his eldest son.",
  "[action] The second son enters the room quietly.",
  "[says] (to Chen Fu) Tells father about selling fields",
  "the second son (to Chen Fu): \"I have sold the field in the south of the town for a good price. I will divide the money with you, for I know you are short of cash.\"",
  "[says] (to the second son) Chen Fu expresses his anger at his son's betrayal.",
  "[action] The eldest son leaves the room silently and walks out to the fields.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"Well, and I will sell the other field!\"",
  "[action] calls second son",
  "Chen Fu (to the second son): \"Come back to me, my son!\"",
  "Chen Fu (to the second son): \"We will sell both fields, and you shall have the money, for what is mine is yours.\"",
  "[silence] Chen Fu says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Chen Fu leaves, avoiding his eldest son.",
  "[action] (to the second son) The eldest son walks into the fields and sees his father's land and the crops.",
  "Chen Fu: \"Let the harvest be cut in the fields,\"",
  "[says] Chen Fu expresses frustration.",
  "[says] Chen Fu expresses his frustration."
